			<div class="content" id="post-content-4494112">
									

<p>Okay let me write this up again because oh my God.</p>
<p>I want to thank Zyn the most for the opportunity to try this one again. I'll always appreciate how kind she is to me and how we were able to come up with an SCP we're both happy with.</p>
<p>I want to thank RockTeethMothEyes and cybersqyd for the greenlights to my original idea so that I can finally try to make an SCP (and fail LMAO).</p>
<p>Thank you to OriCat for providing help with my original draft, I'm sorry you weren't able to help much on this iteration but I appreciate you regardless.</p>
<p>Thank you to Geka-Gaku, DianaBerry, Mew-ltwoverse, Calibri_Bold, Simartar, and Snappy for liking the draft tonight when Zyn and I were flailing it around.</p>
<p>Thanks to uhh everyone in genchat that is super cool and chill I appreciate yall.</p>
<p>And thanks to AbsentmindedNihilist for inspiring me with <a href="/scp-3807">SCP-3807</a> and your goofy Egyptian mythos shenanigans. Sorry for no crosslink this iteration ;-; it didn't mesh with the new idea as well as it did before but I'm still grateful that you'd let me do it the first time.</p>

